tracks.description:
Official partner ERP Ukraine implemented Odoo to the biggest ukrainian non profit organization - Ukrainian Red Cross Society with 4000+ employees and 600+ users. Thanks to the partner experience, Odooo implementation methodology and ukrainian localization unattainable tasks have become real.
Theses we want to discuss:
Ukrainian accounting in Odoo for NGO;
localized salary and HR for 4000+ employees;
volunteer portal;
logistic and fleet management;
central office management for 600+ users;
scaling plan for regional organizations.
Speakers:
Alina Lisnenko, Business Analytic (ERP Ukraine)
Olena Stokoz, Deputy Director General for Organisation Development and Resources Mobilisation (URCS)
